===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}} {{tlb|en|non-Oxford British spelling}}

# The process by which something or someone (usually a word) is made more [[English#Adjective|English]]. Usually applied to [[language]] or [[culture]].
#: {{syn|en|Anglification}}
#: {{usex|en|{{m|en|Dublin}}, the name of the capital of [[Ireland]], is an '''anglicisation''' of the [[Gaelic]] name {{m|ga|Dubh Linn}}.}}

